.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Draws a map of 20 countries, turns it into a planar graph (one vertex per country, an edge for each shared border), and colors it. Exact backtracking search needs exactly four colors, as Guthrie conjectured and Appel and Haken proved, while the fast greedy heuristic can waste a fifth color on the same map.">

